p with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Catalyst_Crafting\" title=\"Catalyst Crafting\">Catalyst Crafting</a></b>, Turn in <a href=\"/page/Item:Legendary_Cowl_of_the_Devotee\" title=\"Item:Legendary Cowl of the Devotee\">Legendary Cowl of the Devotee</a>, its Legendary <a href=\"/page/Deep_Catalyst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deep Catalyst\">Deep Catalyst</a> and 5 <a href=\"/page/Item:Legendary_Abyssal_Gem\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Item:Legendary Abyssal Gem\">Legendary Abyssal Gems</a> at the <a href=\"/page/Strange_Catalyst_Forge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Strange Catalyst Forge\">Strange Catalyst Forge</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Freedom_of_Movement_(item_enchantment)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Freedom of Movement (item enchantment)\">Freedom of Movement</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Freedom_of_Movement_(item_enchantment)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Freedom of Movement (item enchantment)\">Freedom of Movement</a>:</b> This item grants its wearer the ability to move and attack normally while under the influence of magic that impedes movement, such as paralysis, solid fog, slow and web.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Dodge_bonus\" title=\"Dodge bonus\"> Dodge +16%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Dodge_bonus\" title=\"Dodge bonus\"> Dodge +16%</a>:</b> +16% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Dodge.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sheltering\" title=\"Sheltering\"> Sheltering +41</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sheltering\" title=\"Sheltering\"> Sheltering +41</a>:</b> +41 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Nearly_Complete\" title=\"Nearly Complete\">Nearly Complete: Healing Amplification</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Nearly_Complete\" title=\"Nearly Complete\">Nearly Complete: Healing Amplification</a></b>: This item isn't quite finished, but it's only a step away from completion. Bring it to the forges on the upper floor of <a href=\"/page/Gravenhollow\" title=\"Gravenhollow\">Gravenhollow</a> and combine it with melted materials to restore this item to its full potential.</span></span><br />\n<ul><li>This item can be upgraded with one of the following:\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Healing_Amplification\" title=\"Healing Amplification\">Competence Healing Amplification +62</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Healing_Amplification\" title=\"Healing Amplification\">Healing Amplification</a></b>: This effect amplifies all incoming positive energy healing by +62 (<a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a>). Includes spells, potions, and other effects.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\